<p>Using previous program experience. From Scarlet (Gimbaled 2024-2025) the mass of the avionics was ~500 grams, but increased to ~800 grams on HPRTVC. In order to accomodate other rocket changes, such as an improved gimbal, the mass budget for the avionics bay is slightly reduced. This is assumed to be practical, considering electrical team goals to make a lightweight, compact flight computer.</p>
